{"author":{"uri":{"label":"https://itunes.apple.com/us/reviews/id1528536976"}, "name":{"label":"Поларис ´ཀ`"}, "label":""}, "updated":{"label":"2026-11-22T09:26:16-07:00"}, "im:rating":{"label":"3"}, "im:version":{"label":"10.11.1"}, "id":{"label":"14821420698"}, "title":{"label":"The social aspect..."}, "content":{"label":"I don't really know what to think. I think secret chats are very cool, a fun way to connect with people. HOWEVER the moderation is terrible. As a trans man, I know first hand how absolutely homophobic and transphobic people are. The moderation does hardly anything to protect people, and just lets the bullying happen. Not to mention how many times I've had people push christianity on me and nothing is done. It's a period app, not a bible app. Along with that, I've had posts get taken down for absolutely NO reason. Sometimes no reason is given for why something is taken down, or other times it was \"giving person information\" when the post was a screenshot of a comment section with names blurred???\n\nMoving on to the actual period tracking, the push for flo premium is wayyyyy too much. I came to this app to learn about my period, not to have everything blocked by a pay wall. You shouldn't have to PAY to change your profile image 💔. And I can't really look at why stuff for my period is happening, cause the pay wall is massive.\n\nI'd like if eventually more language options were added that let you access secret chats, not just English and Portuguese. Also, people want the \"self care\" tab back, or at least a tab for outfit of the day's specifically. That and \"memes\" were the best part of the social aspect of this app and it feels like it was taken down for no reason 😭\n\nSo overall, please work harder to protect minorities. It's stupid that I have to say it. I get bullied practically every day for being in the community and moderation has only protected me once or twice (I've been using this app since September 2025).", "attributes":{"type":"text"}}, "link":{"attributes":{"rel":"related", "href":"https://itunes.apple.com/us/review?id=1038369065&type=Purple%20Software"}}, "im:voteSum":{"label":"0"}, "im:contentType":{"attributes":{"term":"Application", "label":"Application"}}, "im:voteCount":{"label":"0"}}, 
{"author":{"uri":{"label":"https://itunes.apple.com/us/reviews/id1994093736"}, "name":{"label":"needmorejars"}, "label":""}, "updated":{"label":"2026-11-22T09:14:59-07:00"}, "im:rating":{"label":"3"}, "im:version":{"label":"10.11.1"}, "id":{"label":"14821382379"}, "title":{"label":"The Annoying Push for Premium Access"}, "content":{"label":"I have had flo for many years. It has helped me in my teens due to having irregular periods and even now where they are now more regular. It’s easy and insightful but it’s so annoying how much you cant see or use due to not having the “premium version” of flo. Im sorry but I personally feel that it should either be free or SO much cheaper. I personally only use it to track my periods and intimacy days, but I would use it more if things were more accessible for free or CHEAPER. \n\nAlso, when you don’t have the subscription to the app, it BOMBARDES you with pop ups about buying the damn premium version, that you HAVE to click on in order to exit it out.", "attributes":{"type":"text"}}, "link":{"attributes":{"rel":"related", "href":"https://itunes.apple.com/us/review?id=1038369065&type=Purple%20Software"}}, "im:voteSum":{"label":"0"}, "im:contentType":{"attributes":{"term":"Application", "label":"Application"}}, "im:voteCount":{"label":"0"}}, 
{"author":{"uri":{"label":"https://itunes.apple.com/us/reviews/id323911431"}, "name":{"label":"DaughterofTheKing1121"}, "label":""}, "updated":{"label":"2026-11-22T06:52:21-07:00"}, "im:rating":{"label":"1"}, "im:version":{"label":"10.11.1"}, "id":{"label":"14820883922"}, "title":{"label":"Pop-up to subscribe if you click on anything"}, "content":{"label":"The first time I was pregnant. I feel like I was almost scammed into subscribing because that was the only way I was able to find out anything about my baby and pregnancy. It was like $65 for a year for information I could find on other apps or now  AI can basically tell you everything. I’m trying to use the app again now and you can even look at or click on anything without having a pop up asking you to subscribe to learn about anything. Everything on it is a tease and the app is basically pointless without you having to pay money for stuff you can find elsewhere!", "attributes":{"type":"text"}}, "link":{"attributes":{"rel":"related", "href":"https://itunes.apple.com/us/review?id=1038369065&type=Purple%20Software"}}, "im:voteSum":{"label":"0"}, "im:contentType":{"attributes":{"term":"Application", "label":"Application"}}, "im:voteCount":{"label":"0"}}, 
